    <guid isPermaLink="false">696b07df109824f9e1f1a1c6</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 17 Jan 2026 03:58:25 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>本期节目你会听到但不只：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>🔸 为什么我们渴望“被看见”？</span></p><span></span><p><span>🔸“被讨厌的勇气”到底是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span>🔸 阿德勒心理学核心工具：</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>“课题分离”</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>——一句话减少90%内耗</span></p><span></span><p><span>🔸 从“求认可”到“自我确认”：如何把存在感从别人手里拿回来</span></p><span></span><p><span>🔸 真正成熟的连接，是从“我不怕被你讨厌”开始的</span></p><span></span><p><span>🔸 </span><strong><span>三个马上能用的落地话术，学会建立边界</span></strong></p><span></span><blockquote><span>每次内疚时问一句：</span><strong><span>“这是谁的课题？”</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>每次想解释时停三秒：</span><strong><span>“我是在沟通，还是在求饶？”</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>每次害怕被讨厌时提醒自己：</span><strong><span>“自由一定有代价，我付得起。”</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span>BGM：&lt;</span><strong><span>I Don't Care&gt;</span></strong><span> by Adam Christopher</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你也喜欢本期节目，别忘记订阅《</span><strong><span>科研指北</span></strong><span>》</span></p><span></span><p><span>BTW欢迎你加入科研指北大家庭</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiZ2AbPlQsQdik-5LUejq1YsPNbW.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
